Zero point energy                ...      0.25225303 Eh     158.29 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01027831 Eh       6.45 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
